/P 155 0 R
/E (The analytical model incorporates procurement, supplier, shipment, logistics, and target information. The model uses a Galaxy Schema with two fact tables: actual procurement data at PO-line grain and targets at category-month grain. Conformed Date and Category dimensions filter both facts, enabling accurate actualversus-target analysis.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
